==Trivia==
*The word "''Cannon''" comes from the Akkadian word "''𒄀''" (''qanû''), meaning reed. Cannons were invented in China during the twelvth century. It was most likely developed in parallel or as an evolution of an earlier gunpowder weapon called the fire lance. Cannons were used for warfare by the late thirteenth century in the Yuan dynasty and spread throughout Eurasia in the fourteenth century. During the late Middle Ages, large and small cannons were developed for siege and field battles. The cannon replaced prior siege weapons such as the trebuchet. After the late Middle Ages, most large cannons were abandoned in favor of greater numbers of lighter, more maneuverable field artillery.
**The Cannon is 1 of 4 [[cards]] associated with cannonry, with the others being [[Royal Giant]], [[Cannon Cart]], and [[Cannoneer]].
*The Cannon is 1 of 7 [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]] which first existed in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Mortar]], [[Tesla]], [[Goblin Hut]], [[Inferno Tower]], [[Elixir Collector]], and [[X-Bow]].
**The Cannon resembles the old Level 4 Cannon from Clash of Clans.
*While not available as a building in Squad Busters, the Cannon reappears there when spawned by a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Cannon_Spell Cannon Spell].
*The Cannon, along with the [[Tombstone]], are the cheapest buildings, costing 3 [[Elixir]].
*Among all buildings that can attack, the Cannon is tied with Tesla for the shortest range of all buildings, with a range of 5.5 tiles.
*The Cannon is one of the first building cards to be featured in a [[Training Camp|Trainer]]'s [[Battle Decks|deck]], alongside the Goblin Hut, Tombstone, [[Bomb Tower]], Inferno Tower, and [[Barbarian Hut]].
*The Cannon is 1 of 23 cards that has had its Elixir cost changed, the others being [[Bomber]], [[Fire Spirit]], [[Royal Recruits]], Mortar, [[Musketeer]], [[Three Musketeers]], [[Heal]], Goblin Hut, Bomb Tower, Barbarian Hut, [[Furnace]], Elixir Collector, [[Skeleton Army]], [[P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Electro Giant]], [[Bowler]], [[Goblin Barrel]], [[Barbarian Barrel]], [[Rage]], [[Fisherman]], and the [[Monk]].
**The Cannon, the Mortar, and the P.E.K.K.A were the first cards whose Elixir cost was changed since the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]].
**Out of all cards whose Elixir cost was changed, the Cannon has had the largest change in Elixir, with a change of 3 Elixir.
*The Cannon shares the first part of its description with the Tesla.
*Although Cannons themselves can only target ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]], the [[King's Tower|King Tower]]'s cannon can target both air and ground troops. This might be because the cannon is elevated on the tower.
*The Cannon is unavailable in multiple [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|special game modes]]. More specifically:
**It is 1 of 20 cards that is unavailable in [[Mirror]] mode, the others being [[Minions]], Mortar, Tesla, Goblin Hut, Tombstone, Bomb Tower, Inferno Tower, Barbarian Hut, Furnace, Elixir Collector, [[Freeze]], [[Clone]], X-Bow, [[Golden Knight]], [[Skeleton King]], [[Archer Queen]], [[Mighty Miner]], [[Little Prince]], and the Monk.
**It is unavailable in [[Global Spell|The Floor is Healing]] sub-[[:Category:Modes|mode]] of the Global Spell game mode, much like other building cards, as well as the Cannon Cart.
*The Cannon has received the largest percentage debuff to a singular upgradeable stat out of all cards in the game, with a 55% hitpoints decrease in the February 2016 Update.
*The Cannon has had balance changes that were planned for it but were not added to the game. More specifically:
**The initial balance change for Cannon on the [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/10/2022)|4/10/2022 balance changes]] was a 14% hitpoints decrease, but it was lowered to 8% [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-40-balance-wip last minute].
**The initial balance change for Cannon on the [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|4/3/2025 balance changes]] was a 6% damage decrease, but it was changed to an attack time interval increase to 1 second (from 0.9 seconds) [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-69-balance-wip-march-2025 last minute].
*Before the Cannon's card release, the Cannon's hitpoints were increased by 42%.
